If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician provides a qualified-opioid-use-disorder-treatment-specialist-search-assistance to a patient for a qualified-opioid-use-disorder-treatment-specialist and arranges a specialist-follow-up for the patient with the qualified-opioid-use-disorder-treatment-specialist and coordinates a continuing-care for the patient with the qualified-opioid-use-disorder-treatment-specialist.
